editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-59.md-85-He went over it as he would have gone over a return. The case was shut for cause. There were names in it, and what was done to their owners; and there was a leaf in it that was no copy. It would be opened on a day, before the right people, or it would burn those whom it was kept for. He did not doubt that. He had audited it on a great many watches.
