editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-55.md-157-*The read: the floor, through water and a plate. All of it, for three counts of warning.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-55.md-158-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-55.md-159-*Compression: the strike, standing. The old ribs. Ten days, she says.*
