editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/B7-RECONCILIATION-H-RERUN.md:142:> - **Cael:** nineteen. **There is no birthday in this book.** His own Arbiter woke at Kindling, its plate lit eleven seconds late, the failed-safe word replaced the old name, and it went dark; he has no Path. He has **ten confirmed fragments**: Wind (Lira), Pressure (`the Bronze from Ardenmere` in spoken inventories), Iron (Brom), Compression (Reydan), Ember (Karis), Shadow (Seln; sealed; used exactly twice, at Ring and Stair), Storm (Daeva), Anchor (unnamed; used once each way), Blade (Ephram), and Tide (Oryn; partial; Iron; self and contact; clinical; *ask first, every time*). Deployment since the Line: **twenty-seven**. **The still place** is not a fragment and is not counted: read three times, told to Oryn and then described to the other four, untouched since Oryn ordered him to write it down and stop touching it. His ribs have been quiet since the morning of day 129. The living purse holds 96 marks. Open accounts are listed below; `nothing owed` is false.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/B7-RECONCILIATION-H-RERUN.md:143:> - **The five at Lowmarch:** Lira (Wind, Iron R1 formal) has all eight left-forearm marks whole, but the arm is slung high and holds nothing until Oryn says; the right ankle is taped and unmended. She carries Oryn's crossbow, hook and one bolt and cannot span it herself. Brom (Iron Skin, Copper formal) has the right shoulder mended twice, not a third, held in four yards of webbing by the drover's turn; the older healer says it will do. Karis (Ember, **Iron Rank Three**) has 52 copied sheets (11 Ring / 29 Stair / 12 Hall), the dead surveyor's ledger, the carter's map with four circles and the line off the hide, and the Ternhall straightedge; her voice is whole and her larger hypothesis remains unspoken and unentered. Seln (Shadow, Bronze; fifteen years' service) has his **locked case**, carried shut for twelve years and unopened. Cael has Hesk's brass straightedge and satchel.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/B7-RECONCILIATION-H-RERUN.md:150:> - **Who knows the integration mechanism:** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln and Oryn — six. Oryn knows sources by Path and not by person except those she has touched; she does not know Seln supplied Shadow-adjacent. **Not** Vastin, Teague, Pike or Cleon. All six know the still-place phenomenon; only Cael and Oryn are shown hearing/saying its label.
