+> **Still-place sharing:** all six know the phenomenon. Cael said the label `the still place` to Oryn; the other four were told the three-sentence description without the label.
+>
+> **Karis knows:** 52 sheets (11 Ring / 29 Stair / 12 Hall); 41 kinds at Ring/Stair and 33 of those 41 on the sampled Hall wall; the three centres lie on one straight edge and a fourth circle lies on that line. Her larger hypothesis is unspoken and unentered. She knows `[UNBOUND]` only as the one-time stratum limit from Book 7 edition `chapter-42.md:269`; she does not yet know what the kit's index indexes.
