+## 2. Resolution of every former PENDING finding
+
+- **A1 is resolved, adjusted:** the detailed seam is no longer provisional. Keep day 131, but specify the lower inn hearth after Oryn's letter and the pattern sentence; the ferry closed the previous day (`chapter-60.md:47–95,219–265`). Remove all proposed PENDING warnings; do not insert them.
