+| Deployment count | Final total is **twenty-seven** (`chapter-55.md:301`; `chapter-60.md:31`). The trace is 13 at the M6 close (`chapter-40.md:389`), Tide on Oryn at the ridge = 14 (`chapter-48.md:277–281`), nine Stair deployments = 23 (`chapter-51.md:197–217`), three counted Hall deployments = 26 (`chapter-55.md:153–163`), and Tide on Oryn during the telling = 27 (`chapter-55.md:297–301`). The Hall kerb trial is not a counted use (`chapter-53.md:295–333`). | Add the exact total, trace and exclusion to the entry ledger. |
