696-- **Knowledge:** all six know Cael functioned inside the Ring and know that his self-reading found something, but none except Cael knows what; Oryn knows the mechanism but not that Seln supplied Shadow; Karis’s hypothesis is neither spoken nor entered; the Quieting name and five findings are shared; nobody has put a verb between the facts (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:11–105,113–117`).
697-- **Research state:** Karis’s kinds-count is covered and unsaid; finding four says only “five or six”; stake thirty-two remains Lira’s guess; the four wheres include two map rings marked *guess* and Seln’s unplaced childhood round (`manuscript/chapter-41.md:125–159`; `chapter-43.md:3–53`; `chapter-44.md:71–95`).
698-- **Open accounts:** Pike has eight completed lines but the crew has not heard the eighth read at the board; the Fallow hundred remains in Pike’s box, the ferryman’s rope and two HOLD slips remain unresolved, Hesk’s parcel has not arrived, three letters are unanswered, and seven hounds remain untracked (`manuscript/chapter-40.md:221–263,383`; `AUTHOR-REPORT.md:173–179`).
699-- **Oryn:** day 112 closes just short of the mill; she is sixteen late out of Thornwater and seventeen late at Oxhollow, has left the mule, and has not forgiven Cael or received the self-reading (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:223–301`). Her exact location on day 113 is Millrace under M7, subject to the protected north conflict (`packets/MOVEMENT-007.md:30`).
